# Closeout — ROOT08 worker storage strategy

Safe partial optimization implemented: the existing worker uses512-byte comparison scratch instead of a redundant16896-byte observed image. Both native CAS pre-read and bootstrap read-back still compare all bytes. Committed/previous/next, issuer history, snapshots/pins, Stop and UNKNOWN retention remain intact.

[Lifetime/strategy proof](storage-lifetime-proof-and-handoff.md) · [Census](ed11-census.json) · [Exact approved patch](exact-source.patch) · [Test results](test-results.json) · [Hashes](final-manifest.json).

Known current composition improved by16384 bytes to2067655. The hypothetical full ROOT08 composition improves from2171399 to2142951 but still exceeds the unchanged limit by45799. No full ROOT08 capacity increase was applied or qualified. Task remains partial.

